{"summary":"Smash, crash, and crush! This game will blow away your stress.","description":"Destroy all the bricks in the world! Simply aim, fire, and watch the bricks shatter. It’s the perfect way to relax and kill time.\n\n[Game Goal]\n\nClear the Board: Destroy all bricks to win the stage.\n\nBreak Them Down: Bricks are destroyed when their durability reaches 0.\n\nDefend the Line: Game over if the bricks reach the bottom of the screen.\n\n[How to Play]\n\nTouch & Aim: Touch the screen to set the firing angle.\n\nFire: Release your finger to shoot the ball in that direction.\n\nUse Items: Utilize power-ups to clear stages more easily.\n\n[Game Features]\n\nThousands of Stages: Play thousands of levels for free.\n\nSimple Controls: Easy one-handed gameplay.\n\nEndless Mode: Challenge yourself for a high score in endless gameplay.\n\n[Notes]\n\nSave Data: Game data is stored locally. Deleting the app or changing devices may result in data loss.\n\nMonetization: This app contains ads and in-app purchases.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $99.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QG_k0vkiVjc?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yeRVCQih2Px6XHkegqVmbhcE15KFyGpGii0R13SAJ_nE5h6Fhp4wubluBeDqAHeN-6_UadCAViiygrGNb8H1","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/svBrstG-UbfqijLCahSqepqBITd3dEJ9J3VOOtOCuJJCn7tm6LcOHXeVkmdp-E23WO_7GfL1jQLrvDEGTrVexw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FhyvTiKVtdA1mD2luto1-60Loj_c96cILkU-ho6v-k5LmQ4yle2_W6ROeaytgrPHrwssjJBNOSINDL68iVgXzA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Fe9_wu9vwmHE4l1MEXZH89b8BbvtxEMbe0LDTrRAP9srTLc3Hyilj_ysYBA3BoWMuyQDFL6qIbzW8R8XxHhGJ6A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gNLHGyqUM-gzMc4C1jihBCYwyeZN4nv8V2dq-Y5QZNIwfEV8uMI49sfxuYPNwBCD1Oj6-cxn5sE6BbH-R0hcHw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9qzU0x5eRN-WASmTso3Vef9uttBKqVWH-eEyLRsaC6d7wcfcA1ytxSwOE-2KN4XSRuHmHlY7YekWya_7iiA16A","https://play-lh.googleuserconten